# Blade (optional)

Copy this rule into the app's `.cursor/rules/` only when the UI is Blade. Skip for API-only apps.

**Do:** escape with `{{ }}`; `@csrf` on state-changing forms; prepare queries in the controller (no `User::all()` in the template); reuse existing layouts/components.

**Don't:** `{!! $userInput !!}` for untrusted HTML; query Eloquent inside views; introduce a JS SPA when the app is Blade.

Baseline a11y: labels for inputs, keyboard-reachable controls, status not by color alone.
